= Juan-Simeón Vidarte

Vidarte is a deputy secretary of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> executive, a lawyer who keeps a close watch on the officer corps and public order. He favors defending the Republic by broadening the party's base well beyond the industrial working class.

- @democratic_rally
- @military_affairs
- @support_peoples_party
- @build_peoples_party
- @campaigning_peoples_party
